// Generated by the `:generateIosVersionXcconfig` Gradle task from the root `gradle.properties`
// (`fuelio.versionName`/`fuelio.versionCode`) — the single source of truth for the app version
// (docs/adr/0009-release-pipeline-and-versioning.md). Committed rather than gitignored: Xcode reads
// xcconfig files before running any build phase, so a script phase cannot regenerate this file in
// time for the same build to see it. Run `./gradlew generateIosVersionXcconfig` after bumping the
// version in gradle.properties, before building iosApp.
CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION=2
